---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Cookie Policy | SendCrypto.io" description="SendCrypto.io Cookie Policy. Detailed information about what cookies we use and how to manage your preferences.">
  <Nav slot="nav" />
  <main>
    <div class="ltag">// cookies</div>
    <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
    <div class="lmeta">Last Updated: May 30, 2026 · GDPR Compliant</div>

    <h2>1. What Cookies We Use</h2>
    <p><strong>Strictly necessary cookies (no consent required):</strong> These enable core site functionality and cannot be disabled. They include session management cookies that expire when you close your browser.</p>
    <p><strong>Analytics cookies (consent required):</strong> We use Cloudflare Web Analytics which is privacy-first and does not use cookies by default. If you enable enhanced analytics via our consent banner, we may set anonymous session cookies to measure aggregate site usage.</p>
    <p><strong>We do not use:</strong> advertising cookies, third-party tracking pixels, cross-site identifiers, or any cookie that enables profiling.</p>

    <h2>2. Your Choices</h2>
    <p>You can:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Accept or reject analytics cookies via our consent banner (which appears on your first visit)</li>
      <li>Change your preferences at any time by clearing your browser's localStorage and revisiting the site</li>
      <li>Disable all cookies in your browser settings (may affect site functionality)</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Third-Party Cookies</h2>
    <p>Google Fonts and Cloudflare may set limited technical cookies as part of service delivery. These are governed by their respective privacy policies. We do not allow third-party advertising cookies on this site.</p>

    <h2>4. Cookie Duration</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Session cookies: deleted when you close your browser</li>
      <li>Consent preferences: stored in localStorage for 12 months, then re-requested</li>
      <li>Analytics cookies (if accepted): 90 days maximum</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>5. Withdraw Consent</h2>
    <p>To withdraw analytics consent, clear your browser localStorage for sendcrypto.io and decline analytics on the next consent banner.</p>

    <h2>6. Contact</h2>
    <p><a href="mailto:contact@sendcrypto.io">contact@sendcrypto.io</a></p>
  </main>
  <Footer slot="footer" />
  <style>
    main{position:relative;z-index:1;max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:140px 40px 100px}
    .ltag{font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;font-size:.72rem;color:var(--accent);letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:16px}
    h1{font-size:2.5rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1.1;margin-bottom:12px}
    .lmeta{font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;font-size:.75rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:48px;padding-bottom:32px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
    h2{font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);margin:40px 0 14px;letter-spacing:.02em;text-transform:uppercase}
    p{color:rgba(240,244,255,.8);margin-bottom:16px;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.75}
    ul{margin:0 0 16px 20px;color:rgba(240,244,255,.8);font-size:.95rem}
    ul li{margin-bottom:8px;line-height:1.7}
    strong{color:var(--text)}
    a{color:var(--accent)}
    @media(max-width:768px){main{padding:100px 20px 60px}}
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
